home=home.replace('href="/battery-components">Explore this component','href="/mould-making">Explore this capability')
home=home.replace('BRINGING<br><span class="outlined">GOOD IDEAS</span><br>TO LIFE.','YOUR PART.<br><span class="outlined">OUR MOULDING</span><br>EXPERTISE.')
home=home.replace('We bring design, tooling and injection moulding together. So every component starts with a better conversation, and finishes with the attention it deserves.','We manufacture plastic injection-moulded components for different applications. From a drawing, sample or 3D model, our team connects material selection, mould development, production, inspection and assembly around your component.')
home=home.replace('across Tooling operations and Production operations.','across two manufacturing units.').replace('Tooling operations and Production operations share','Our two manufacturing units share').replace('Tooling operations includes','Unit 1 includes').replace('Production operations includes','Unit 2 includes')
home=re.sub(r'<section class="battery-journey tubular-study".*?</section>','''<section class="deep-section light application-example" id="battery-application"><div class="story-split"><div><p class="story-kicker">ONE APPLICATION OF OUR MOULDING CAPABILITIES</p><h2>Battery packing items.<br>Part of a wider capability.</h2><p>Battery-related plastic packing items and component concepts are one part of our work. The same design, tooling and injection-moulding process supports household, electrical, industrial, automotive and agricultural applications.</p><a class="story-link" href="/battery-components">Explore the battery component study <span>↗</span></a></div><figure style="margin:0"><img src="/assets/components.webp" alt="Examples of moulded plastic housings, covers and functional parts" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Plastic component examples supplied for the company website.</figcaption></figure></div></section>''',home,flags=re.S)
home=re.sub(r'<section class="injection-overview".*?</section>','',home,flags=re.S)
overview='''<section class="injection-overview" id="injection-moulding"><div class="injection-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT WE DO / PLASTIC INJECTION MOULDING</p><h2>From polymer granules.<br>To a part with a purpose.</h2></div><p>Injection moulding turns a specified plastic material into repeatable components using a precision mould. We work on the part, the tool and the production process together - from a first sample to ongoing manufacturing.</p></div><div class="injection-cycle"><div class="injection-machine"><img src="/assets/moulding.webp" alt="Plastic injection moulding machine" width="1068" height="546" loading="lazy"><span>THE INJECTION MOULDING CYCLE</span></div><div class="cycle-explainer"><p class="eyebrow">SELECT A STAGE TO EXPLORE</p><div class="cycle-buttons" aria-label="Injection moulding cycle stages"><button data-cycle="0" aria-pressed="true">01 / Clamp</button><button data-cycle="1" aria-pressed="false">02 / Inject &amp; pack</button><button data-cycle="2" aria-pressed="false">03 / Cool</button><button data-cycle="3" aria-pressed="false">04 / Open &amp; eject</button></div><div id="process-output" aria-live="polite"><h3>01 / Clamp &amp; prepare</h3><p>The mould closes and the clamping system holds the halves together. Approved material preparation, mould condition and machine setup establish the starting point.</p></div><a class="text-arrow" href="/machinery">Explore our moulding machines <span>↗</span></a></div></div><div class="injection-proof"><div><strong>2</strong><span>Manufacturing units</span></div><div><strong>6</strong><span>Injection moulding machines</span></div><div><strong>40-500 T</strong><span>Clamping-force range</span></div><div><strong>2006</strong><span>Year established</span></div></div></section>'''
home=home.replace('<section class="mission"',overview+'<section class="mission"',1)
home=re.sub(r'<section class="injection-planning".*?</section>','',home,flags=re.S)
planning='''<section class="injection-planning"><div class="injection-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">DESIGNED FOR THE COMPONENT. PLANNED FOR PRODUCTION.</p><h2>More than a machine.<br>A complete moulding process.</h2></div><p>A successful moulded part depends on the application, material, tool and machine working together. We review these details before planning a job.</p></div><div class="injection-details"><article><span>01 / PART &amp; MATERIAL</span><h3>Start with how the part will work.</h3><p>Share the application, drawing, sample, material preference, colour, critical dimensions and expected quantity. We process PP, PPCP, PE grades, ABS, PC, Nylon, POM, PMMA and elastomers, subject to the approved requirement.</p><a href="/plastic-applications">Materials &amp; applications ↗</a></article><article><span>02 / MOULD &amp; TOOLING</span><h3>Build the process into the tool.</h3><p>Part reviews, core and cavity design, cooling, ejection, machining and mould trials connect the drawing to a practical production tool. Our in-house tool room also supports repairs and modifications.</p><a href="/mould-making">Mould development ↗</a></article><article><span>03 / PRODUCTION &amp; INSPECTION</span><h3>Control the process. Check the part.</h3><p>Match the mould to a suitable machine, establish the process, inspect samples and monitor production. Finishing, assembly and packing can form part of the agreed scope, from short runs to higher-volume orders.</p><a href="/quality">Our quality approach ↗</a></article></div><div class="injection-sectors"><span>APPLICATION AREAS</span><a href="/plastic-applications">Automotive</a><a href="/plastic-applications">Electrical</a><a href="/plastic-applications">Household</a><a href="/plastic-applications">Industrial</a><a href="/agriculture">Agriculture</a><a href="/battery-components">Battery packing items</a></div><p class="injection-note">Machine capacity and component suitability depend on mould dimensions, shot requirements, material and part geometry. Share your drawing or sample for review.</p></section>'''
home=home.replace('<section class="expertise-section">',planning+'<section class="expertise-section">',1)
home=home.replace('<p>THE PRECISION REVOLUTION.</p>','<p>PLASTIC INJECTION MOULDING.<br>TOOL DESIGN. MOULD DEVELOPMENT.</p>')
path.write_text(home,encoding='utf-8');(root/'public/index.html').write_text(home,encoding='utf-8')
print('Applied injection-moulding-first homepage and retained battery components as a secondary application.')
